# 3. Test POST order

Use Postman or curl:

```bash
curl -X POST http://34.100.200.50/orders \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d "{\"userId\":\"1\",\"productId\":\"101\",\"quantity\":2}"
```

The complete flow is:

```text
                 POST /orders
                      │
                      ▼
             34.100.200.50
                      │
                      ▼
              GCP Load Balancer
                      │
                      ▼
                   Ingress
                      │
                 /orders
                      │
                      ▼
               order-service
                      │
              ┌───────┴────────┐
              │                │
              ▼                ▼
       user-service      product-service
              │                │
              ▼                ▼
          User Pod         Product Pod
```

This is a very good demonstration of **Ingress + Service Discovery + Microservice Communication**.

