## One thing I'd change next

For your **learning project**, this HTTP Ingress is perfect. After you get this working, I'd modify the architecture to:

```text
                         Internet
                            │
                            ▼
                   GCP Load Balancer
                            │
                            ▼
                         Ingress
                            │
                 ┌──────────┼──────────┐
                 ▼          ▼          ▼
               users     products    orders
                 │          │          │
                 ▼          ▼          ▼
              Services   Services   Service
                                       │
                              ┌────────┴────────┐
                              ▼                 ▼
                         user-service     product-service
                              │                 │
                              └────────┬────────┘
                                       │
                                  PostgreSQL
```

Then we can add **Helm + HPA + ConfigMap + Secret + PostgreSQL + Redis + Kafka/Pub/Sub**. That will make this much closer to a real enterprise GCP microservices deployment.
